window.products.push({"id":1110020,"name":"England Glass Beer Stein with Pewter Lid and Pewter Medallion","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816-DpJ4mEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Union Jack in red, white & blue colors is prominently displayed on both sides of this direct screen wrap-around body design. In the center is an appliqué inspired by Big Ben and the Queen's Guards. The word England appears on a ribbon at the bottom of the appliqué. On the lid is the official England Coat of Arms inscribed with the words ENGLAND.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816-DpJ4mEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GermanStein","source_asin":"B00ANT4VQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ANT4VQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ANT4VQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110021,"name":"BISSELL Cleanview Rewind Pet Deluxe Upright Vacuum Cleaner, 24899, Green (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TgqG5LlxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TgqG5LlxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07VMHMMSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VMHMMSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VMHMMSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110022,"name":"Emerson HSP2600 Whole House Steam Humidifier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CYLsuZz6L._AC_SL1430_.jpg","description":"The White-Rodgers HSP2600 is a 240-Volt 2000-Watt whole house steam powered humidifier that includes the stainless steel humidifier assembly, automatic flushing timer, automatic humidistat, water filter, saddle valve, fan control relay, blower safety switch, and mounting frame. Steam humidifiers provide the most precise humidity control. The steam humidifiers do not require hot air as with the evaporative models that wait for the furnace to run. When the humidistat detects the need for humidity, the steam humidifier is turned on. The steam humidifier has a thermal switch that is wired to turn on the furnace blower. Analysis of your water quality and treatment is a necessity to prevent premature corrosion of the heating element. White-Rodgers is a business of Emerson Climate Technologies, the world's leading provider of heating, ventilation, air conditioning, and refrigeration solutions for residential, industrial, and commercial applications. Combining technically superior products and services from industry-leading companies and brands with global engineering, design, distribution, installation, and monitoring capabilities help Emerson Climate Technologies to create reliable, energy efficient climate systems that improve human comfort, safeguard food, and protect the environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CYLsuZz6L._AC_SL1430_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emerson Thermostats","source_asin":"B004494IFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004494IFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004494IFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110023,"name":"HUSGA Butterfly Wall Decor, 3 Sizes Butterfly Cake Decorations, Three-Dimensional Hollow Design Hanging Butterfly for Garden Themed Tea Party Graduati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714jR-o4LiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you're looking for stunning, romantic and unique decor, then our 3D removable butterfly wall decals would be ideal! Nice designs Our 3d butterfly wall decor are pre-assembled, easy to decorate. Share DIY fun with your family or friends, eye-catching 3D design create mood-enhancing atmospheres and relaxation for you and guests.  Can be used as wedding, birthday, party, nursery, christening, festival celebration decorations, photography background, dessert table decor, cake refrigerator fridge stickers or cupcake toppers, butterfly gift for kids or girlfriend. It makes your life more colorful and lovely. Specifications Butterfly Color: Gold/Rose gold/Silver Size: 12cm / 4.72\", 10cm / 3.94\", 8cm / 3.15\" Different shapes and sizes of colorful butterflies will make your life more colorful and beautiful. Instructions 1. Make sure the surface is smooth, don't stick on rough or uneven surface, clean up the ash and grease, keep it dry and clean.  2. Fold the butterfly wings so that the butterfly shows 3D effect. 3. Place double-sided foam tape on the bottom of the butterfly. Attach the butterfly to the wall and push firmly to prevent the butterfly from falling. Warm note The wings can be displayed at different angles to add different visual delights to the decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714jR-o4LiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUSGA","source_asin":"B09NRL1KS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NRL1KS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NRL1KS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
