window.products.push({"id":1110201,"name":"Dyson DC35 Purple Refurbished 22377-03","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-H59i2KQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dyson Digital Slim vacuum cleaner has twice the suction power of any other lightweight cordless vacuum cleaner in use, making it the most powerful cordless vacuum. It is ideal for quick, flexible cleaning on all floor types, stairs, upholstery and inside the car. Dyson engineers developed the DC35 for versatile spot cleaning- itís suitable for every floor surface: carpet, vinyl, tile and wood. It has a motorized floor tool with two types of brushes. Ultra-fine conductive carbon fiber brushes remove fine dust from hard floors. Rotating nylon bristles remove ground-in dirt from carpets. The detachable long-reach wand is made from lightweight aluminium. It reaches high, low and into awkward spaces. You can also remove it and use DC35 as a handheld. A docking station conveniently stores and recharges the machine when not in use, or the battery can also be recharged separately from the machine. The DC35 has a dual power mode that gives you the option of 15 minutes of constant high suction or 6 minutes of MAX suction for more difficult tasks. Itís designed for both larger, longer jobs and tough spot-cleans ñ with just a push of the button.Like all Dyson vacuum cleaners, DC35 has patented Root Cyclone technology ñ so it doesnít lose suction as you vacuum.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-H59i2KQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dyson","source_asin":"B008FP8X6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008FP8X6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008FP8X6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
