window.products.push({"id":1110206,"name":"Acacia Wood Pizza Peel, Upscale Large Paddle for Baking Homemade Pizza and Bread, Cheese Board, Platter, Charcuterie Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+JqW4WDWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wooden Pizza Peel by Mint Meets Ginger is crafted specifically for the pizza maker, home chef and artisan baker. Luxuriously designed acacia wood pizza paddle is the perfect match for any kitchen décor, gourmet pizza parlor and bakery. In addition to its natural rich pattern, it's incredible strength prevents warping and subdues heat from transferring pizza and baked goods to and from an oven/grill. Bake and serve fresh piping hot pizza with a dash of tradition with the Mint Meets Ginger 11\" x 18\" Acacia Wood Pizza Peel. Trust us to update Old School pizza making with simple, everyday style for today’s kitchens. This sturdy wooden pizza peel features robust acacia construction, finished with food-safe natural oil to bring out the beautiful wood grain. The peel is ample enough to use as a work surface for kneading pizza dough or for cutting cheese, veggies, meats, and cold cuts. It even provides a handy place to let dough rise before you shape it. Deliver a touch of brick-oven-pizza style to the home kitchen with this beautiful pizza peel. The peel is also great for use with breads, calzones, quesadillas, naan, and other flatbreads. It even provides a great-looking platter for serving appetizers and other foods. Partner this pizza lover’s must-have with Moscow Mule large cheese platter and get the party started and keep it going, slice by slice, cocktail by cocktail. Features: Finished with food-safe natural oil to protect and preserve the beautiful woodgrain  Use for sliding pizzas, breads, and other baked goods in and out of the oven; also makes a handy kneading surface and serving piece. Ideal for homemade breads, freeform pies and tarts, and other delicious baked treats Hand wash only","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+JqW4WDWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mint Meets Ginger","source_asin":"B06WP4KSTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WP4KSTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WP4KSTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
