window.products.push({"id":1110275,"name":"CHEFLY Stainless Steel Pasta Maker - 9 Thickness Settings Dough Roller & 2 Blades Noodle Cutter & Fixation Clip for Fresh Homemade Lasagne Fettuccine ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716Yj4v0lsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Quickly Creating Deluxe Pastas】- Simplify the job of making your own nutrient pasta at home,you can get that perfect fresh flavor and texture more often. More time saving and easier to get the shape and texture just right. Including lasagne, fettuccine,linguine,spaghetti,farfalle. ✅【Adjustable Dough Roller with 9 Thickness 】- Just pull and rotate the knob to the clearly labeled setting.You can adjust the space of two paralleled rollers from 0.5-2.5mm. Sheets of dough can be rolled to 9 different thicknesses. Which provides more possibilities to explore your creativity with pastas. ✅【Dual-bladed Pasta Cutter】- Pasta cutter with two blades cuts 7mm fettuccine and 2mm spaghetti easily just by turning the handle crank . Convenient to get the delicious food with this noodle making machine. (The noodles will swell after cooking) ✅【Retainer Clip Helps The Machine Anchor On Countertop Steadily】- It grips well onto the edge of a counter. Two hands were more than enough to make the pastas. Whether you make pastas with family or only by yourself, You'll have much fun making it from scratch. ✅【Sturdy Construction Can Last Long】- The net weight is 5.6 pound(2.55KG).Heavy duty enough. Mainbody is made of stainless steel to ensure corrosion resistance, Roller and blades are made of carbon steel with plated layers to increase the hardness. The machines are Engraved with \"CHEFLY\" Logo. Our customer service will reply you and help you solve any problems in 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716Yj4v0lsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHEFLY","source_asin":"B095HFHPP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095HFHPP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095HFHPP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110276,"name":"Wildkin Kids 7 Pc Full Bed In A Bag for Boys and Girls, Microfiber Bedding Set Includes Comforter, Flat Sheet, Fitted Sheet, Two Pillow Cases and Two ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81St0XHP0+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sweet dreams are a breeze when your little one is snuggled up in our Olive Kids by Wildkin 7 Piece Full Bedding Set! The 7 Piece Full Bedding Set comes complete with a printed comforter, flat sheet, fitted bottom sheet, two coordinating pillowcases, and two embroidered shams. The Twin Comforter, flat sheet, and fitted sheet all fit a standard full mattress. The included matching pillowcases and shams all fit a standard pillow. The Full Comforter features a 100% microfiber exterior that’s perfect for cozy cuddles. This lightweight material makes it breathable enough for hot summer nights, while keeping your little one nice and warm during colder months. Featuring vibrant, playful Olive Kids designs on each of the seven included pieces, your little one will love this fun new addition to their room. While the exterior of the Full Comforter is bursting with character, the cozy microfiber interior is solid, creating a sweet contrast. The coordinating flat sheet, fitted sheet, pillowcases, and shams tie the theme together for a bold, whimsical look that you and your little one will love. Each 7 Piece Full Bedding Set was designed to coordinate with other Wildkin room décor. From plush pillows, to toy chests, to storage cubes, your little one will love seeing their favorite designs pop up throughout their room. The 7 Piece Full Bedding Set is machine washable, because accidents happen. Machine wash pieces separately on a cold, gentle cycle. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry on low heat. Warm iron as needed. Please wash prior to use. One-year manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-safe, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Commission. From the Manufacturer 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-safe, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Commission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81St0XHP0+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wildkin","source_asin":"B0896165YW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0896165YW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0896165YW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
