window.products.push({"id":1110370,"name":"Personalized Stoneware Black Crock - 1-Quart, Natural Finish, Customizable Utensil Holder Housewarming Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615+XPdrZ3L._AC_SL1168_.jpg","description":"Tidying up the counter is even more special when you have a personalized onequart stoneware crock For centuries, these pottery crocks were primarily for food storage such as butter and fruit or to ferment vegetables. Nowadays they're more commonly used as kitchen utensil holders or rustic flower pots but they still work great for traditional American foodstuffs.When we add a handpainted message to our custom stoneware crocks, they'll feel even more special. Messages can be two lines with up to 12 characters per line. Use this space for a family name, inspirational words or create a personalized holiday gift. The text for your memento can be applied in five different bright colors that stand out on the counter.Grace your kitchen with a countrystyle personal ceramic crock that adds vintage beauty. Each onequart crock is made from genuine glazed stoneware with a lustrous natural finish. Select your text color to begin personalizing your new utensil crock or give us a call if you need help. We've been a trusted supplier of functional everyday merchandise for more than 70 years and are happy to assist you. Please note: At this time, we are only able to personalize characters from the English keyboard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615+XPdrZ3L._AC_SL1168_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WalterDrake","source_asin":"B077TCTYWZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077TCTYWZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077TCTYWZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
