window.products.push({"id":1110383,"name":"De Buyer Mineral B Element Iron Frypan, Round with Neoprene Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rf2Svp+eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The most cookware on Earth. This pan is 100-Percent Natural with 99-Percent pure Iron and a Bee Wax Finish to fight against oxidation while helping season the pan. This pan is excellent for Sealing, Browning, and Grilling. The more the pan is used, the better the performance as the chef creates their own non-stick surface. The darker the pan becomes the better it is for natural non-stick properties. This pan has no PTFE or PFOA and has no chemicals added. Environment safe production in France by De Buyer Industries which has been in business for 180 years. Tradition is the key as Mineral Pan is an authentic French design called \"Lyonnais\" shape with a curved handle \"a la Francoise\". It is a symbol of French Gastronomy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rf2Svp+eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De Buyer","source_asin":"B01G3Z7ZSA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G3Z7ZSA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G3Z7ZSA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110384,"name":"30\" Polished Chrome Closet Rod W/ End Supports","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41P6jDLRrRL._AC_.jpg","description":"An amazing price for such a high quality closet rod! There's a whole lot to love about this complete closet rod kit. Let's start with the rod itself. Its oval profile (very popular in European markets), offers a more streamlined appearance while maintaining an incredible degree of strength. It's made of extruded steel, which means it's completely seamless and smooth all around. It has a highly polished nickel finish, which will keep it looking like new for years to come. We guarantee that you'll be just as happy with the end supports. They're made of cast metal (not stamped steel), and have the same highly polished nickel plating as the rod itself Installation - First of all, please note that this closet rod in intended to be mounted onto a wood surface. Each end support has 2 rear facing pins which you'll need to drill 2 corresponding holes for. Once that's done, all it takes is a single screw (provided) to hold the rod in place. After the supports are mounted, it's just question of cutting the rod to the desired length, which can be easily done with a hacksaw...Done! Here's what you get... 1 polished nickel 29 3/4\" long oval rod2 polished nickel end supports 2 mounting screws","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41P6jDLRrRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hafele","source_asin":"B00AEVVTNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AEVVTNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AEVVTNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
