window.products.push({"id":1110550,"name":"Howard Elliott 99132 Mirrored Pedestal Table with Offset Opening, Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31KKYhMqpDL._AC_.jpg","description":"This mirrored pedestal table features a mirrored body with an offset central opening. Each mirrored panel has a small Bevel that adds to the table's style and beauty. Every surface is mirrored allowing for the most amazing reflections of light and color. Pair this with the larger sized table for a great display in your home. This mirrored pedestal will look great in an entryway, hallway, living room or any place you need a pedestal! Dimensions: 12\"W x 12\"D x 25\"H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31KKYhMqpDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Elliott Collection","source_asin":"B0160RN6LQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0160RN6LQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0160RN6LQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110551,"name":"PÜRATest pH Meter and TDS Meter (Beige) Combo Pack with pH Buffer Powder Solution - Water Testing Meter Accurate Reading, Auto Calibrate, Temperature,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ObgHVxQbL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"pH Meter Tester: - No calibration needed for new purchased item, just immerse the electrode and wait for about 30~60 seconds to get the accuracy readings. - Use the 6.86 pH buffer powder for calibration after a long time /frequently using or when ultra accuracy is needed. Specifications: - Measuring range: 0.0 ~ 14.0 PH - Resolution: ± 0.01 PH - Accuracy: ± 0.05 pH (20°C/ 68°F) - Batteries: 2 x 1.5V batteries (included) - Automatic temperature compensation: 0~50°C /122°F Dimensions: 5.85 x 1.28 x 0.78 inch Weight: 1.80oz /51g Lifetime: Approx. 700 hours. Package includes: 1 x pH Meter, 2 x 1.5V LR44 button batteries (built-in), 3 x Calibration packets, 1 x Carrying case, 1 x User manual. The PURAtest TDS Meter is a professional level water test meter that fits in your pocket! TDS testing is a great tool for drinking water, water filtration and purification, hydroponics (test your nutrients), aquariums, RO/DI systems, pools and spas, and more. A TDS meter typically displays the TDS in parts per million (PPM). For example, a TDS reading of 1 ppm would indicate there is 1 milligram of dissolved solids in each kilogram of water and 0 ppm being pure H2O. A TDS Meter indicates the Total Dissolved Solids (TDS) of a solution, i.e. the concentration of dissolved solids in it. Since dissolved ionized solids such as salts and minerals increase the conductivity of a solution, a TDS meter measures the conductivity of the solution and estimates the TDS from that. - Hold Function: Saves measurements for convenient reading and recording. - Auto Shut-Off Function: Meter turns off after 8 minutes of non-use to conserve batteries. - Dual range: Measures from 0-999ppm, with a resolution 1ppm, from 1000 to 9990ppm. - The resolution is 10 ppm, indicated by drinking *10 symbol. - Factory calibrated. - Range: 0-9990ppm. - Accuracy: +/-2%. - Battery: 2*1.5V(AG 13 button cell). - Size: 6.1\" x 1.2\" x 1\" in. - Weight: 3 oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ObgHVxQbL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unido Box","source_asin":"B01LXU7ETQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXU7ETQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXU7ETQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
