window.products.push({"id":1110574,"name":"Mini Bag Sealer, Cadrim Mini Bag Sealer Handheld, 2 in 1 Portable Heat Vacuum Resealer and Cutter, Rechargeable Mini Bag Sealer, Food Sealer for Plast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VhJj05rCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 in 1 Sealer&Cutter】- Small body contains two functions - one side is used for opening your bag, the other side is used as a bag sealer. The heating element and the slide switch resists high temperature and prevent accidental press. With an unique magneton the bottom and one lanyard in the top, this bag sealer mini makes it convenient to be adsorbed on the refrigerator or hang from any corner when not in use. It is an essential kitchen accessory. 【Keep Food Fresh & Taste】The bag sealer for food plastic bags design with adopt advanced micro heating technology to quickly and evenly seal the bag, effectively seal and block airborne dust. Keep all foods fresh and dry. Magnetic bottom, can be adsorbed on the refrigerator or any stationary metal surface so you will keep it handy in your kitchen. 【Widely Use for Bag】Mini bag sealer machine can seal multiple common packaging bags with thickness that is 0.3mm or less, such as storage bags, chips bags, snack bags, PP, PE, PVC bags etc. Not suitable for Pure paper bags, pure aluminum bags. Come with 1 x Mini Bag Heat Sealer, 1x Mini USB Cable, 1 x Use Manual. Any issue when using, please feel free to contact us, we will response you ASAP. Three temperature levels-Double Heating Wire: Our chip bag sealer from monofilament fever upgraded to double heating wire, which adopt double heat sealing construction, and combined with principles of hot melt sealing, easy to seal bags. 0.13 inches sealing caliber which seal more stronger without air leakage. Make sure foods has its original flavor when you eat in next time. Temperature adjustment function is suitable for bags of different thickness. 【USB Rechargeable Heat Sealer & Magnetic Back Design】 The bag sealer mini is rechargeable and equipped with a USB charging cable. One charge can be used for 1-2 months. Please use a 5V output voltage adapter for charging. It has a magnet on the bottom to stick on the fridge or other metal surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VhJj05rCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cadrim","source_asin":"B09YVCTTQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YVCTTQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YVCTTQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
