window.products.push({"id":1110607,"name":"Yankee Candle Home Fragrance Oil - Honey Clementine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31AcuhDUzkL.jpg","description":"About Home Fragrance Oil Infused with natural essential oils, Yankee Candle Home Fragrance Oil is the purest, most concentrated form of Yankee Candle fragrance. Use in a fragrance oil warmer to scent a room in just minutes. (.33 fl. oz.) About This Fragrance Refreshing orange takes a sweet turn in this honey-dipped citrus delight. Fragrance Notes: Top: Orange Peel Mid: Clementine Base: Honey Top note is the initial impression of the fragrance, middle note is the main body of the scent and base is its final impression.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31AcuhDUzkL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yankee Candle","source_asin":"B01L6S96MC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L6S96MC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L6S96MC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110608,"name":"Magnetic Poetry - The Poet Kit - More Essential Words for Your Refrigerator - Write Poems and Letters on The Fridge - Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zyHmHlc8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This collection (a staff-favorite here at MagPo) was specially selected from the lists of words sent to us by Magnetic Poets from around the world. Using these suggestions, we created The Poet Kit, a set of over 300 words perfectly suited for creating lush and evocative lines of poetry. This magnetic muse is guaranteed to spark the imagination and usher you into all kinds of unexplored poetic realms! CONTAINS - over 300 magnetic word tiles in a cute, colorful, giftable 4.75 x 6 inch box. Rearrange the words to write poems, messages to your roommates, or generative esoteric word art masterpieces whose meaning is lost even to you. Magnetic Poetry is both a creative writing aid, and just a really fun and limitless toy. They're not just fridge words, you can write an ode on your commode, an elegy on your doorknob, a haiku on your car hood, or a novelette on your omelette maker. MIX AND MATCH WITH OTHER KITS - Tile height is 0.375 Inches, compatible with nearly all other Magnetic Poetry sets. With dozens of other themed kits, the possibilities are endless. You can mix and match to create custom combinations, and custom gift ideas. Magnet words make a great dorm room accessory, or locker decoration. They're also a perfect gift for poetry lovers, or a gift for writers of any kind, and as a graduation present, you can't go wrong. MADE IN THE USA - Magnetic Poetry sets are made in America, are nontoxic, and comply with all American and international safety guidelines and regulations. Magnetic Poetry is the inventor of the magnetic word tile, and we're still a small US company that takes great pride in every set we make. Read more about our company in the product description below. OVER 100 DIFFERENT SETS - Please click on the Magnetic Poetry brand name below the title of this page to browse other sets made by us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zyHmHlc8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magnetic Poetry","source_asin":"B000GYUYH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GYUYH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GYUYH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
