window.products.push({"id":1110815,"name":"Leggett & Platt Gotham Metal Daybed with Latte Finished Button-Tufted Upholstery and Brass Studs, Brushed Copper, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":499.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jpiPGqDtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Gotham Daybed employs contrasting materials and rich neutrals to create the perfect piece for any guest room, office or den. Constructed of carbon steel for strong support and long life, the metal frame has a rustic Brushed Copper finish and lined with antique-looking studs to add an extra layer of appeal to this already stunning daybed. The panels are upholstered in a soft Latte finished, polyester fabric with button-tufting on the back. The Gotham is truly a versatile piece of furniture. A 14-inch space between the floor and daybed base is available for storage. This unit includes a back panel, (2) side panels, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. A link spring and mattress are not included with this daybed frame and need to be purchased separately. The Leggett & Platt Gotham Metal Daybed Frame comes with a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jpiPGqDtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B016J46SYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016J46SYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016J46SYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110816,"name":"KATSURA Woodworking Project kit Japanese VG-10 67 Layers Hammered Damascus Steel 8 inch Gyuto Chef Knife Blank Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uGSNXdUPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Katsura Knife Making Blank – YOU determine the best knife handle material to suit your needs! Experience has taught us that there’s nothing like digging in and getting started. Even, if you’ve never made a knife before you can try your crafting skills with simple or even makeshift tools! The thrill of carving, grinding, shaping, and buffing your own handle is unbelievably satisfying. Be proud of what you can create even if the end result is less than perfect. The KATSURA VG-10 Damascus Gyuto Chef Knife Blank comes with a blade blank only, allowing for a design-it-yourself handle made from the material of your choice. We recommend using Micarta, softwood, hardwood, metal or even paracord! Features: ➤ The blade is crafted by folding 66 layers of Japanese Damascus steel over a Japanese VG-10 steel cutting core with a 62+ Rockwell hardness. ➤ Easy to Maintain – With superior edge retention the blade will stay ultra-sharp for years to come. When needed the fine, yet tough edge is easy to sharpen. ➤ The handle is perfectly weighted and balanced. It features a full tang and 3-pin design with 4 sets of pins included. ➤ Mince, slice, and dice with ruthless efficiency. Designed to suit the cutting techniques used by professional Japanese chefs, Katsura knives bring culinary mastery to any kitchen. ➤ Ideal gift- Create a custom handle and present as a gift to the best cook in your family. Or buy for your friend or family member who loves carpentry or woodworking. Every KATSURA knife comes inside a handcrafted gift box.USE AND CARE: not for chopping bone; do not use on hard surfaces like granite, tile, or glass cutting boards; wash by hand with gentle dish soap, rinse, and dry with a dishcloth; sharpen with a whetstone at an angle of 15 degrees. Limited lifetime warranty, full satisfaction guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uGSNXdUPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KATSURA","source_asin":"B07BFDY3TF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BFDY3TF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BFDY3TF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
