window.products.push({"id":1110820,"name":"Wallies 12244 Mod Leaves Prepasted Paper Cutouts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T9QHKskAL._AC_SL1056_.jpg","description":"WALLIES are a new unique way of decorating. You simply wet the back with a sponge and stick them to your walls, lamps, furniture, cabinets, stationery or many other surfaces. They are made of pre-pasted, vinyl-coated, strippable wallpaper and are easily applied to most smooth surface. WALLIES are vinyl-coated so they can easily be wiped clean, they can withstand moisture, even in a bathroom! WALLIES can be used almost anywhere, on walls, furniture,cabinets, stationary, gift boxes, craft objects, ceramic tiles, memory books and covers, lamp shades...the list is endless. WALLIES are applied easier than a roll of wallpaper, without the mess, without the measuring, without cutting and without the need of a helper. WALLIES are easily removed by wetting them again. Easy to use and offered in a wide variety of styles, these prepasted, vinyl-coated wallpaper cutouts are a wonderful way to create great looking accessories and wall décor with just a little water and no artistic talent required. Put them on lamp shades, cabinets, ceramic tiles, tin waste baskets, gift boxes, and, of course walls. The possibilities are endless! WALLIES cutouts are easier than wallpaper rolls—no mess, no measuring and no cutting! WALLIES are easier than stenciling; you can put them up in minutes! WALLIES will quickly enhance and beautify any smooth, flat surface looking like you spent painstaking hours handpainting your project. But all you do is wet and apply. A sponge or paper towel and water are all the supplies you need. WALLIES are strippable. To remove, simply wet the cutouts very well and peel them off; the glue is water soluable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T9QHKskAL._AC_SL1056_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallies","source_asin":"B005YTG7LI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005YTG7LI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005YTG7LI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110821,"name":"Chef’s Knife Roll Bag(Ver. 2.0), the Lightest and Portable Waterproof Knife case, Customized Durable Knife Carrier – 7 knife guards included (Vintage ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614OyLZqqKL._AC_.jpg","description":"✔👜CARRIT CHEF'S KNIFE ROLL BAG is the lightest(300g) and smallest knife roll ever designed. It is designed with durability and functionality as well as character and style to create a timeless and beautiful roll that you will carry with pride. Also, CARRIT is Water repellant Waxed Cotton Vegan Fabrics that express the vintage texture of real leather. It is Hand-Washable, Ironable, and not rusted through good Ventilation and strong Dehumidification. ✔A UNIQUE & UNFORGETTABLE GIFT FOR CHEFS🎁 – A Perfect Gift for Culinary Students, An Aspiring Chef or Professional Chefs. Get Preferred Colors from Various Color Options. Also, It's delivered in a luxurious and stylish case. You can engrave the NAME/LOGO EMBROIDERY on the knife bag. Embroider Your Loved One’s Name and Make It Unique and Special Gift. ✔4 TYPES DOUBLE RESISTANCE SHEATHS INCLUDED - You don't need to buy it separately because 4 types 7 functional sheaths are provided. Two sheaths overlap per pocket, parallel to the height of the handle of the knife making it compact and slim. Also, the interior of the sheath is designed with double resistance, maintaining strong durability even after storing sharp knives for a long time. Store safely and clean with different types of sheaths that fit the size of the knife! ✔VEGAN BRAND - We do not use animal skins, but use special fabrics that express the vintage texture of veggie skin to protect animals.🌱 We also participate in efforts to reduce environmental pollution by minimizing harmful substances that occur during processing of artificial leather and by using 100% biodegradable poly mailer, knife sheaths made of reused plastic and biodegradable vinyl. ✈⏰The delivery is likely to be faster than scheduled because we use Overseas Express. If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us anytime. We value communication with our customers❤","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614OyLZqqKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carrit","source_asin":"B08QV5BJR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QV5BJR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QV5BJR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110822,"name":"Toucan H-9401-12 Can Opener Hands Free Automatic, 2.9 x 7.5 x 9.5 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-t7O98k6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Opening cans, what a pain! Not anymore - with the TouCan Can Opener, the world's easiest hands free automatic can opener. With two times the power, TouCan Can Opener opens cans of all shapes and sizes with just the push of a button. Its uniquely designed blade clamps down on the lid from the outside and the onboard magnet keeps dirty lids from falling into the can, and the lid is reusable so you can store what you don't use! TouCan's extraordinary design also helps you remove the toughest bottle caps and breaks that tight seal so you can easily twist off jar lids. TouCan is perfect for people with arthritis, hand or joint pain. TouCan is the last can opener you will ever need to buy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-t7O98k6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOUCAN","source_asin":"B01JQW41NE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JQW41NE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JQW41NE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
