window.products.push({"id":1110934,"name":"AeroBed Premier Comfort Quilt, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31EZV1CKGDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The 18821 AeroBed Premier Comfort Quilt twin size bed looks like an everyday spring constructed mattress, but feels like no other guest bed you have ever slept on. The quilted jacquard mattress ticking cover provides the ultimate in comfort and durability and the new One Touch comfort control wand puts adjustable firmness at your fingertips. Set-up and take down is a snap with the powerful built-in pump that inflates the bed in less than 60 seconds, while the patented Quick Air Release Valve deflates the bed in less than 15. Includes a carry bag for easy storage. Amazon.com The AeroBed Ultimate air mattress takes inflatable sleeping surfaces to a new level. Designed to fill in just 60 seconds, the mattress uses a recessed inflation pump to prevent clutter around the bed and maximize the comfort of the sleeper. In addition, a hand-held Comfort Control lets you adjust firmness with the press of a button. For deflation, simply engage the air-release valve, and the mattress is ready to fold up in just 15 seconds. Made of heavy-gauge PVC vinyl material, the mattress is non-allergenic, durable enough for everyday use, and made to be placed on a floor, a box spring, or a sofa bed. Inside the mattress, Aerobed's Quadra Coil design creates a smooth, lump-free surface, while the included quilted jacquard mattress ticking cover improves the cushion and comfort of the bed. The mattress comes in multiple sizes, and a carrying bag and 14-foot power cord are included. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31EZV1CKGDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AeroBed","source_asin":"B00024BZ7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00024BZ7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00024BZ7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
