window.products.push({"id":1110951,"name":"NeuType Vanity Desk with Mirror and Lights, Makeup Vanity with 4 Drawers, Vanity Mirror with Lights and Table Set, 3 Lighting Modes Brightness Adjusta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":246.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HnwMJF+aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE STORAGE CAPACITY: Overall size – 39.3”W x 15.7”D x 55.7”H . Makeup vanity with 3 large storage shelves on desktop and 4 drawers (including a large drawer with ample storage), providing plenty of room for your cosmetics, jewelry, and other beauty supplies. VANITY TABLE SET WITH LIGHTED MIRROR: The vanity mirror features an built-in LED light strip, which is more safe than common bulbs. With warm white/natural white /cold white, three-tone settings, adjustable brightness meets your personal makeup requirement during the day and night. REMOVABLE MIRROR, ADJUSTABLE 3-DRAWER CHEST: The LED mirror of the vanity table can be easily assembled or disassembled, which is functional and giving you extra lighting. The adjustable 3-drawer chest can not only meet your needs for storage, but also adjust the length on the basis of space and your needs. DURABLE MATERIALS: Made of 15mm medium-density MDF, 12mm thickness mirror frame, and high quality metal legs, ensure the vanity sturdy enough. The height of the stool is appropriate, and proper bottom space is reserved, which can satisfy the sitting posture of you. The velvet cushion is super comfy too. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: For installation, please refer to our manual (each bag of accessories/screws are numbered) or the video on the page. The large drawer comes pre-assembled, so even you are not a areprofessional, you can make it. Don't worry about the broken mirror or missing parts. If this happens, please contact us as soon as possible and we will reship it for you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HnwMJF+aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NeuType","source_asin":"B0C36J3Q25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C36J3Q25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C36J3Q25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
