window.products.push({"id":1110998,"name":"Halloween Poker Picks, 200 Orange Black Plastic Toothpicks, 2.75\" Small Food Picks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E9QwNhw4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy an appetizer or drink with our “4-Aces” card suit picks. Our plastic 4-Aces picks are just the thing for garnishing drinks or tasty treats. These versatile 2 3/4” colorful picks feature a different card suit design (Hearts, Diamonds, Spades and Clubs) at the top and lend themselves perfectly to a poker party or any get together. Soodhalter Plastics has manufactured plastic party picks in Los Angeles, California since 1949. We bring three generations of family experience to party, bar, and picnic products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E9QwNhw4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soodhalter Plastics Inc.","source_asin":"B01LZF3TNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZF3TNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZF3TNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1110999,"name":"DII 60x120\" Rectangular Cotton Tablecloth, Yellow & White Check - Perfect for Spring, Summer, Farmhouse Décor, Picnics & Potlucks or Everyday Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3Kb1KHdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\" A Classic Every Day & Every Season Look Our Checkered Linen Collection incorporates all tabletop textiles a hostess may need for dining room. Providing a selection of different colors, you are sure to find a one to match your décor. With quality in every thread these durable, long lasting tabletop textiles are a must with a timeless design that will make a statement all year long. This look can go places and can easily be incorporated into many different styles for your home including farmhouse, relaxed and informal, timeless, or cookout. Our collection includes tablecloths, table runners, and napkins. Tablecloths That Have You Covered No matter the size or shape of your table we have something for you. With five sizes to choose from and one round tabletop option you can add color and interest to your dining room. Our table cloths are 100% cotton with a 1” hem and mitered corners. Let your dinnerware stand out with our color fast, wrinkle resistant tablecloths, sure to make a statement for family and guests. Your table can be dressed up or down to create the perfect place setting, whether for a family gathering, BBQ, or party these can be used indoor or out. Table Runners Our table runners provide a great place to set down platters to prevent spills and scratches on your tabletop while adding style and flair. These runners can be used on more than just the dining room table; place on entryway, foyer, console, or coffee table surfaces while still showing off the furniture. Set plants or other centerpieces atop the runner to update any space with a fresh new look. Napkins Finish off your tabletop with matching napkins, made oversized to handle any meal no matter how messy. We make it simple to coordinate the perfect table setting, mix and match with our tablecloths and table runners to complete the look for your setting. All of these products are machine washable simply follow these care instructions: machine wash cold separately. To minimize the shrinkage, tumble dry low, remove just prior to being completely dry. Low iron if needed. So Many Great Options To view our entire selection of kitchen & tabletop linens search: DII Tabletop or visit our store front by clicking the DII link at the top of the page to view our other collections. Other Collections Include: Pet Pet Storage Storage Indoor & Outdoor Rugs Indoor & Outdoor Rugs Aprons Aprons Dishtowels Dishtowels Ceramics Ceramics Throws Throws Laundry Bins Laundry Bins Bath Linens Bath Linens \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3Kb1KHdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B07JF97HVT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1110999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JF97HVT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JF97HVT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1111000,"name":"OmniMount TRIAP Adjustable 3 Shelf Wall System with Cable Management - Platinum (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310SBSY0TFL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Tria is a 3-shelf do-it-yourself solution that allows you to neatly organize components right under your flat panel without the need to run the connections through your wall. Tria is designed with covers that easily snap on to the spine to route and hide wires. The Tria Series wall shelf systems offer hassle-free shelving and cable management solutions suitable for any environment and can be used with or without a flat panel. User-friendly features like adjustable shelves and paintable, trimmable covers make them customizable for any application. From the Manufacturer Tria is a 3-shelf do-it-yourself solution that allows you to neatly organize components right under your flat panel without the need to run the connections through your wall. Tria is designed with covers that easily snap on to the spine to route and hide wires. The Tria Series wall shelf systems offer hassle-free shelving and cable management solutions suitable for any environment and can be used with or without a flat panel. User-friendly features like adjustable shelves and paintable, trimmable covers make them customizable for any application. Features three fully adjustable shelves with integrated cable management OmniMount Tria features three fully adjustable shelves at 1\" increments, with integrated cable management that hides wires for a clean and neat living room appearance. The paintable and trimmable covers are easy to modify as needed and easy to install. Tria can be used with or without an attached HDTV, and it's compatible with the entire OmniMount Tria line, including Tria 1 and Tria 2. OmniMount: the Choice of Pro Installers OmniMount, an innovator of A/V mounts and furniture for more than a quarter century, is the choice of professional installers and the brand most recommended by flat panel manufacturers. The Tria Series wall shelf systems offer hassle-free shelving and cable management solutions suitable for any environment and can be used with or without a flat panel. User-friendly features like adjustable shelves and paintable, trimmable covers make them customizable for any application. Technical Specifications Max Shelf Support: Up to 30 lbs (13.6 kg) each Max Shelf Support: Up to 30 lbs (13.6 kg) each Mounting: Single-stud Mounting: Single-stud Color: Black with black glass and Platinum with clear glass Color: Black with black glass and Platinum with clear glass Glass thickness: 6mm Glass thickness: 6mm Dimensions: 17.5\" x 50\" x 16.\" (445mm x 1270mm x 419mm) Dimensions: 17.5\" x 50\" x 16.\" (445mm x 1270mm x 419mm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310SBSY0TFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OmniMount","source_asin":"B000FSZF66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FSZF66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FSZF66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
